 tissue fragment with multiple lymph nodes ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE to 3 0cm  The smaller lymph nodes are entirely submitted in cassette J L  A representative section of the largest lymph node is submitted in cassette M  Labeled  left breast additional tissue  are three fibroadipose tissue fragments measuring 5 x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm  and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  The specimen is inked and sectioned to reveal predominately yellow  fatty tissue with focal tan fibrotic areas  Representative sections are submitted in cassette N P  Resident  QUN DONG  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  David L Berger  M D  James Warren May Jr   M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY PART B  LYMPH NODES  LEFT AXILLARY   DISSECTION PART C  BREAST  LEFT ADDITIONAL   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY , Unchecked.
