 CODE  A  nipple and areola B  representative section of superior resection margin nearest biopsy cavity C  representative section of medial resection margin D  representative section of inferior resection margin E  representative section of deep resection margin  nearest biopsy cavity F  representative section of skin with scar  G K  representative section of biopsy cavity L O  representative section of remainder of breast P T  axillary lymph nodes ranging in size from 1mm to 1cm  Resident  Elizabeth Bailey  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  PART   RIGHT BREAST MASTECTOMY   report_end  , Unchecked.
